<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-05T18:53:10.961Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 18:53:10 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;China warned it could cut undersea cables linking Taiwan and the Philippines while increasing patrols near Taiwan, raising maritime tension. The Philippine Coast Guard investigated a Chinese survey ship carrying unidentified equipment inside Scarborough Shoal and deployed its flagship BRP Teresa Magbanua to southeastern Mindanao to intensify patrols and deter illegal activities. The Coast Guard also rescued a ferry in Quezon waters, delivered fuel to fishermen at Scarborough Shoal, and assisted over 150,000 sea travelers during the Undas period. The conflict remains low-intensity, with 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQVTQzT3kxVmMtak9FMGI2bmhlVnFuUkpqUnZtWVE1SFRnaG93UVlOU3ZWQklTRDlqcTFJYTZOQXB1UnkxRHVOSDctN1ZJLTFxVElQeGtFaTRGcXJMZTQ1RGVIM2lXWWNxa3EzWTRNWS1FRWhjZ25BNUY3WnVmeFE3TEFLbi1OZzNQVEhOUFVPaDZ6ZlVaYV81NGVpUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/week-asia/politics/article/3373374/philippine-envoy-says-us-immigration-detention-rules-may-change-after-midterms&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;GMA Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE9iektkYVFSQUJ5T0ZFUzhjRUx4dWlHV1ZSSkVoanh1SUlTRkV6YTNqRDlGdG9RM3Rpd2tZSEl5UzRFNkU2VXpXZHk1SEQ0ZGZraXNITC1pQzhqSzJ5bXFkSmN3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Global Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxObnRSMjJJYlZUc1VibTlCSVdCQlJEOC1CM2R2dlZuR20tREwwYzQwRHFiYnVETGNnWlNtSk9PM3NVYmJzdHNaNzNoLVBGdkZhMEhXOEMxUS0zUkpTM0UweENKUzZoQU0xUV9MSnI4OGN6SGRaQnZyUFNhT1dMdWVnMFFyR0MwVENBR0t3OEZFOHlYMW9DT2VqNjFWS1lqRzl2Wk53ZkZHMzltYnBmZnh3RE1hVkVITmRFbTFET